e and owed $100. The same day they received a second fine and owed $50. Pe...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Person A received a fine and owed<strong> $100<\/strong>. The same day they received a second fine and owed<strong> $50<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nPerson B received a fine and owed <strong>$150<\/strong>.<br><br>Who is more upset?<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"MrAB2","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Person A received a fine and owed $100. The same day they received a second fine and owed $50. Pe...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"A"},"2":{"Display":"B"},"3":{"Display":"No difference"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID12","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Person A received a fine and owed<strong> $100<\/strong>. The same day they received a second fine and owed<strong> $50<\/strong>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nPerson B received a fine and owed <strong>$150<\/strong>."}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID120","SecondaryAttribute":" ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Captcha","QuestionType":"Captcha","Selector":"V2","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Align":"left","Theme":"light"},"QuestionDescription":" ","GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID120","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"&nbsp;"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID14","SecondaryAttribute":"You are going to a sold-out game of your favorite local sports team and you have an extra ticket....","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You ar