 ticket <strong>is $5 which is what you paid for each ticket<\/strong>.<br>\n<br>\nYou want to get rid of the extra ticket and you know the ticket's face value price is $5. You find someone who wants the ticket. There is no law against charging more than the price marked on the ticket.<br><br>\nWhat price do you ask for selling the extra ticket if the person you sell it to...?<br>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID18","SecondaryAttribute":"What price would you have asked for if you found out that the ticket\u2019s face value price was $10 i.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What price would you have asked for if you found out that the ticket\u2019s face value price was $10 instead?<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Game2_2","QuestionID":"QID18","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"FORM","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"What price would you have asked for if you found out that the ticket\u2019s face value price was $10 i...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"If they are a friend","TextEntry":"on","InputHeight":31,"InputWidth":61,"TextEntryValidation":"ValidNumber"},"2":{"Display":"If they are a stranger","TextEntry":"on","InputHeight":29,"InputWidth":61,"TextEntryValidation":"ValidNumber"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"},"QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\tvar inputs = $(this.getQuestionContainer()).select('input[type=\"text\"]');\n\nfor (var i = 0; i < inputs.length; i++) {\n  var input = inputs[i];\n  $(input).insert({before: '$ '});\n}\n\n\n});\n\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnReady(function()\n{\n\t\/*Place your JavaScript here to run when the page is fully displayed*\/\n\n});\n\nQualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnUnload