elector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"yesNo","Type":"likert","Reverse":true}},"LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"You are about to purchase a jacket for $125 and a Bluetooth speaker for $15. The salesman informs...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID34","QuestionText_Unsafe":"You are about to purchase a<strong> jacket for $125<\/strong> and a <strong>Bluetooth speaker for $15<\/strong>. The salesman informs you that the <strong>speaker<\/strong> you wish to buy <strong>is on sale for $10<\/strong> at the other branch store, located <strong>20 minutes <\/strong>away.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWould you make the trip to the other store?"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID40","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine that you are on your way to a music event with a ticket for which you have paid $40. On e...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine that you are on your way to a music event with a ticket for which <strong>you have paid $40<\/strong>. On entering the venue, you discover that <strong>you have lost the ticket<\/strong>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWould you pay $40 for another ticket?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Play1 ","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"yesNo","Type":"likert","Reverse":true}},"LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine that you are on your way to a music event with a ticket for which you have paid $40. On e...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID40","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Imagine that you are on your way to a music event with a ticket for which <strong>you have paid $40<\/strong>. On entering the venue, you discover that <strong>you have lost the ticket<\/strong>.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nWould you pay $40 for another ticket?"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID44","SecondaryAttribute":"Imagine that you go to the gym on a regular basis. Due to your busy working schedule, you can onl...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Imagine that you go to the gym on a regular basis. Due to your busy working schedule, you can only go on Monday nights. The membership to the gym allows you to pay <strong>$20<\/strong> (non-refundable) <strong>per session<\/strong>. One Monday, just after you have paid and changed into your gym clothes, you receive a phone call that requires you to leave and forgo your exercise that evening.<br><br>How well does\r\neach of the following statements capture your feelings about the cost of the missed\r\nworkout?<br>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Gym1 ","QuestionID":"QID44","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","ChoiceColumnWidth":25,"RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Imagine that you go to the gym on a regular basis. Due to your busy working schedule, you can onl...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"I feel like I wasted $20"},"2":{"Display":"I feel like I wasted nothing, since my visit had already been paid for"},"3":{"Display":"I feel like I wasted something, but no specific amount or measure comes to mind"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":6,"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Strongly agree<br \/>\n<br \/>\n1<\/div>\n"},"2":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"3":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"4":{"Display":"&nbsp;"},"5":{"Display":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Strongly disagree<br \/>\n<br \/>\n5<\/div>\n"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"ChoiceDataExportTags":false,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Imagine that you go to the gym on a regular basis. Due to your busy working schedule, you can only go on Monday nights. The membership to the gym allows you to pay <strong>$20<\/strong> (non-refundable) <strong>per session<\/strong>. One Monday, just after you have paid and changed into your gym clothes, you receive a phone call that requires you to leave and forgo your exercise that evening.<br><br>How well does\r\neach of the following statements capture your feelings about the cost of the missed\r\nworkout?<br>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID48","SecondaryAttribute":"You are flying with a friend who has upgraded their ticket to business class and has two coupons,...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"You are flying with a friend who has upgraded their ticket to business class and has two coupons, each worth $35, which could be used to upgrade your ticket from economy to business class. They purchased one coupon for the standard price of $35 and received the other one for free. Just one coupon is required to upgrade your class on the current flight, and your friend offers you the coupon <b>which they purchased<\/b> so that you can upgrade as well.<br>\n<br>\nWhat do you think is the most appropriate thing to do?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Plane1 ","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"You are flying with a friend who has upgraded their ticket to business class and has two coupons,...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Pay your friend $35 for the coupon."},"2":{"Display":"Consider it a gift and not pay for the coupon."},"3":{"Display":"Pay some, but not the full amount for the coupon (for example, half the price)."}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID48","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"You are flying with a friend who has upgraded their ticket to business class and has two coupons, each worth $35, which could be used to upgrade your ticket from economy to business class. They purchased one coupon for the standard price of $35 and received the other one for free. Just one coupon is required to upgrade your class on the current flight, and your friend offers you the coupon <b>which they purchased<\/b> so that you can upgrade as well.<br>\n<br>\nWhat do you think is the most appropriate thing to do?"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID51","SecondaryAttribute":"To ensure the quality of our data we need to know if participants paid attention during the surve...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"To ensure the quality of our data we need to know if participants paid attention during the survey. Please tell us honestly how serious you were in completing the survey.\n<br><br>How serious have you been about filling in the survey?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Att_check","QuestionID":"QID51","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"To ensure the quality of our data we need to know if participants paid attention during the surve...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Not serious at all"},"2":{"Display":"Slightly serious"},"3":{"Display":"Moderately serious"},"4":{"Display":"Very serious"},"5":{"Display":"Absolutely serious"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"To ensure the quality of our data we need to know if participants paid attention during the survey. Please tell us honestly how serious you were in completing the survey.\n<br><br>How serious have you been about filling in the survey?"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID52","SecondaryAttribute":"What gender do you identify as?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What gender do you identify as?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Gender","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","Autoscale":{"YScale":{"Name":"maleFemale","Type":"likert","Reverse":false}}},"QuestionDescription":"What gender do you identify as?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Male"},"2":{"Display":"Female"},"3":{"Display":"Non-binary \/ third gender"},"4":{"Display":"Prefer not to say"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID52","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"What gender do you identify as?"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_1yUDCwQabvjZt6m","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID53","SecondaryAttribute":"What is your age (in numbers)?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"What is your age (in numbers)?","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Age ","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"SL","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","InputWidth":60,"InputHeight":29},"QuestionDescription":"What is your age (in numbers)?","Validat